  "body": "On the [mailing list](https://readable-email.org/list/whatwg/topic/proposal-for-new-input-inputmode-digits), @grimreaper (I think) proposed \"digit\" as an input type. \n\nThere is support for such keyboards on:\n-  [iOS](http://stackoverflow.com/questions/7409990/how-to-limit-ios-keyboard-to-numeric-input)\n- [Android](http://stackoverflow.com/questions/3357302/only-show-number-buttons-on-soft-keyboard-in-android)\n\nIt seems like a sensible addition to the platform.  \n",
